==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|thos||those}}, alteration of {{m|enm|tho||the; those|g=p}}, equivalent to {{suffix|en|tho|t1=the; those|s|pos2=plural ending|nocat=1}}, partly by analogy with {{m|enm|thes||these}}, whose final ''-s'' is original and not a plural ending. More at {{l|en|tho}}.

